    - target: {fileID: 8826465643194921373, guid: f4d12ee87e61f6948966be90e44d7593, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentenceEn.Array.data[6].IsPluh
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8826465643194921373, guid: f4d12ee87e61f6948966be90e44d7593, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentenceEn.Array.data[7].IsPluh
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8826465643194921373, guid: f4d12ee87e61f6948966be90e44d7593, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentenceEn.Array.data[0].Sentence
      value: You're a great shooter, I think I should tell you about the competition
        for the title of chief sheriff of the guardians.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8826465643194921373, guid: f4d12ee87e61f6948966be90e44d7593, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentenceEn.Array.data[1].Sentence
      value: What is the kind of competition? What should I do?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8826465643194921373, guid: f4d12ee87e61f6948966be90e44d7593, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentenceEn.Array.data[2].Sentence
      value: Show aerobatics! Use bounces off the walls and objects to catch the
        most elusive nightmares.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8826465643194921373, guid: f4d12ee87e61f6948966be90e44d7593, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentenceEn.Array.data[3].Sentence
      value: Calculate the trajectory and aim so that the dream ray ricochets and
        hits the target.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8826465643194921373, guid: f4d12ee87e61f6948966be90e44d7593, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentenceEn.Array.data[4].Sentence
      value: Catch it on the bounce - such hits bring EXTRA POINTS!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8826465643194921373, guid: f4d12ee87e61f6948966be90e44d7593, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentenceEn.Array.data[5].Sentence
      value: Surprise everyone - only a true master can clear a dream with one perfect
        shot.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8826465643194921373, guid: f4d12ee87e61f6948966be90e44d7593, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentenceEn.Array.data[6].Sentence
      value: Sounds interesting!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8826465643194921373, guid: f4d12ee87e61f6948966be90e44d7593, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentenceEn.Array.data[7].Sentence
      value: Let's practice. Come into the second room. When you're done, come back
        to me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
